Added per object type controls to the IP Fabric Job form, so a sync can be narrowed to Locations, Manufacturers, Device Types, Roles, Platforms, Interfaces, IP Addresses, Primary IP, VLANs and Cables individually. Deselecting Locations stops them being created, updated or deleted while still syncing the Devices at them, including Devices at Locations that another SSoT App owns. Deselecting Manufacturers, Device Types, Roles or Platforms uses the ones Nautobot already holds without creating any.
